hifiberry-vu-meter packaging notes
=================================

This source package uses the native Rust cargo workflow in debian/rules.

Notes for maintainers:

- Build dependencies are declared in debian/control.
- The package is built directly from this source tree using cargo build --release.
- No vendored crates are shipped in this repository.
- The packaging format is 1.0 as declared in debian/source/format.

If Debian policy requirements change for Rust packaging in future releases,
update debian/rules and debian/control accordingly.
